+
+adi-ds3231-19-5170.pdf  -> v2/vendor/adi/adi-ds3231sn.pdf
+  Maxim Integrated / Analog Devices DS3231, 19-5170 Rev 10 (3/15), 20 pages. The tree's v2/vendor/adi/adi-ds3231.pdf is the
